PN,49611
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1774820541
OL,1,Vk4                              G11/22
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGWEST MIDLANDS CRIME SQUAD
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGDOCUMENTS MISSING
OL,4,D
OL,5, The police team investigating the
OL,6, activities of the West Midlands serious
OL,7, crime squad say important documents
OL,8, have gone missing.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThe squad was disbanded after serious
OL,11,Fallegations of misconduct.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FWest Yorkshire police, who are carrying
OL,14,Fout the inquiry, say 31 files and many
OL,15,Fofficers' notebooks are missing.
OL,17,FThey refer to some of the 750 arrests
OL,18,Fmade by the squad since 1976, but no
OL,19,Fsinister motive was imputed to the
OL,20,Fdisappearance of the documents at this
OL,21,Fearly stage of the inquiry.
OL,23,D]FFromG29-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
